        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Buka Scenario Studio",
          "desc": "Dari sidebar utama, klik menu \"Scenario Management\" lalu pilih \"Scenario Studio\". Klik tombol \"Add New\" untuk membuat scenario baru.",
          "color": "#f97316",
          "bg": "#fff7ed",
          "previewHtml": "<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-orange-50 rounded-lg border border-orange-200\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-orange-100 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-orange-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path></svg></div><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-orange-800\">Navigasi Cepat</p><p class=\"text-xs text-orange-600\">Gunakan shortcut <kbd class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-orange-200 rounded text-xs font-mono\">Ctrl+K</kbd> dan ketik \"Scenario Studio\"</p></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Pilih Tipe Rule",
          "desc": "Di dialog pembuatan, pilih tipe rule. Untuk tutorial ini, pilih \"GENERAL\" (3 langkah, tanpa Use Condition). Beri nama rule: \"Tutorial - Rule Pertama Saya\".",
          "color": "#ec4899",
          "bg": "#fdf2f8",
          "previewHtml": "<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-pink-50 rounded-lg border border-pink-200\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-pink-100 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-pink-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z\"></path></svg></div><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-pink-800\">Pilih Tipe Rule</p><p class=\"text-xs text-pink-600\">GENERAL (3 langkah) atau CONDITION</p></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Isi Parameter Dasar (Step 1)",
          "desc": "Isi field berikut:\n\u2022 Rule Name: \"Tutorial - Rule Pertama Saya\"\n\u2022 Scenario Group: Pilih grup yang sesuai (atau biarkan default)\n\u2022 Description: \"Rule tutorial untuk mempelajari Scenario Studio\"\n\u2022 Risk Score: 50\n\u2022 Priority: 5\n\u2022 Active Period: Pilih \"7 hari\" dari quick preset\nKlik \"Next: Build Flow\" untuk lanjut.",
