          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": "<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg border border-blue-200\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-blue-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M15 15l-2 5L9 9l11 4-5 2zm0 0l5 5M7.188 2.239l.777 2.897M5.136 7.965l-2.898-.777M13.95 4.05l-2.122 2.122m-5.657 5.656l-2.12 2.122\"></path></svg></div><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-blue-800\">Canvas ReactFlow</p><p class=\"text-xs text-blue-600\">6 tipe kondisi, toolbar bawah</p></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Tambah Kondisi Pertama",
          "desc": "Klik tombol \"Add Condition\" di toolbar. Pilih tipe \"CONSTANT\" dari dialog. Di dialog konfigurasi:\n\u2022 Atur atribut yang akan diperiksa (pilih dari dropdown)\n\u2022 Pilih operator (=, \u2260, >, dll.)\n\u2022 Masukkan nilai pembanding\nKlik \"Save\" untuk menambah node ke canvas.",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": "<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-teal-50 rounded-lg border border-teal-200\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-teal-100 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-teal-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 9v3m0 0v3m0-3h3m-3 0H9m12 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path></svg></div><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-teal-800\">Tambah Kondisi</p><p class=\"text-xs text-teal-600\">CONSTANT \u2014 atribut, operator, nilai</p></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "num": 6,
